  "name": "Battleground ghost leaves the spirit guide's resurrection queue out of range and rejoins it on return",
  "contract": "Only a ghost near its own team's spirit guide is resurrected by the guide's spirit heal. A player who dies in a running Warsong Gulch match and releases waits to resurrect at their graveyard without clicking the guide. Wandering out of range (to the Alliance entrance, far from the graveyard) takes them out of the queue, so the next spirit heal does not resurrect them there; walking back into range puts them back in the queue without clicking, and the next spirit heal resurrects them once.",
